&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 18px; text-align: left"&gt;　該当事項はありません&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:NotesChangesInAccountingEstimatesFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
